    "description": "Amana Home Mobile App allows homeowners to remotely monitor and control their Amana Smart thermostat and their Amana communicating heating and cooling systems.\r\nMain features include:\r\n1. Easy to use monitor and control of Amana smart thermostats\r\n2. Easy to edit schedule for Amana smart thermostat\r\n3. Easy to set temperature adjustment, system mode, or away mode\r\n4. Current weather and forecast\r\n5. Receive thermostat reminders and alerts Compatible with Amana smart thermostats",
